      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SKETCHY DYNAMIC (6) went straight to the front and never headed when winning two back but could manage only midfield last time when finished 5th and beaten 20 lengths at Gunnedah (26.60). Solid formlines coming through her last run. Looks the one to beat on her best form. GOOD ODDS CUBA (7) has a fair record and proved too classy last time to win by 0.8 lengths at Taree Super Track in a handy 17.64 beating Key Jasper. Must be included in calculations. NABIAC CITY (8) gave a start after copping a check in running and missed the frame when a 13 length seventh (23.70) at this track in a Grade 5. Better than last start and can bounce back. HOT TO RULE (4) was strongly fancied on the back of a win two starts ago but finished fifth last time (23.42) at this track.",
